      {
        "text": "After the first light-in-the-soil step at Di Qiu, the ground opens on pure darkness. Fang Yuan throws two defensive rank five Shine Back Spike Gu, three investigative type High Observation Gu, one attack type Ten Thousand Heart Piercing Arrow Gu, and nine assistance type Nine Feet Flame Gu into the cave. Grey-yellow smoke rumbles inside without oozing out, and bird and arrow sounds come from within that smoke for seven minutes before darkness returns and the cave vanishes.",
